/newshour/world/7-1-magnitude-earthquake-rattles-japan-but-tsunami-advisory-is-lifted)"},"groundingChunkIndices": [0]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 661,"endIndex": 826,"text": "President Trump Holds White House Meetings with Zelenskyy and Netanyahu\nIn Washington, D.C., President Donald Trump hosted consecutive high-stakes bilateral meetings"},"groundingChunkIndices": [1]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 828,"endIndex": 1020,"text": "He met with Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy—who was in the capital to attend the funeral of late U.S. Senator Lindsey Graham—to discuss Ukraine's defense manufacturing capabilities"},"groundingChunkIndices": [2,3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1022,"endIndex": 1230,"text": "Trump also sat down with Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu for the first time since launching joint military operations against Iran, focusing on the war's progress and the regional security landscape"},"groundingChunkIndices": [3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1232,"endIndex": 1384,"text": "* **Source:** [AP News (via WDRB)](https://www.wdrb.com/news/national/ap-news-summary-at-3-40-p-m-edt/article_e850bdfc-b9b2-5eb3-9791-7686b2450325.html)"},"groundingChunkIndices": [3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1232,"endIndex": 1516,"text": "* **Source:** [AP News (via WDRB)](https://www.wdrb.com/news/national/ap-news-summary-at-3-40-p-m-edt/article_e850bdfc-b9b2-5eb3-9791-7686b2450325.html) / [Reuters](https://www.reuters.com/world/us/trump-welcomes-zelenskiy-ahead-funeral-senate-ally-who-championed-ukraine-2026-07-28/)"},"groundingChunkIndices": [2]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1525,"endIndex": 1685,"text": "Record Wildfires Force Mass Evacuations in Southwest Europe\nUnprecedented wildfires continue to sweep across France and Spain, displacing roughly 330,000 people"},"groundingChunkIndices": [4,3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1687,"endIndex": 1856,"text": "French authorities have ordered an additional 4,000 evacuations from Atlantic coast tourist sites as emergency personnel struggle to contain the rapidly spreading blazes"},"groundingChunkIndices": [3]},{"segment": {"startIndex": 1859,"endIndex": 2011,"text": "* **Source:** [AP News (via WDRB)](https://www.wdrb.com/news/national/ap-news-summary-at-3-40-p-m-edt/article_e850bdfc-b9b2-5eb3-9791-7686b2450325.html)"},"groundingChunkIndices": [3]}],"webSearchQueries": ["bbc news July 28 2026","today news July 28 2026","reuters news July 28 2026","ap news July 28 2026"]}}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 669,"candidatesTokenCount": 652,"totalTokenCount": 3399,"cachedContentTokenCount": 134,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 669}],"cacheTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 134}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 2078,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-3.5-flash","responseId": "fgppavKgEu2Cz7IPsKLE-QM"}

